    <string name="a11y_label">GigGok — let Mind hear calls</string>
    <string name="a11y_summary">Lets Mind hear the caller when she answers for you</string>
    <string name="a11y_desc">Android lets no app hear audio during a call unless it runs this service · GigGok uses it only so Mind can listen to the caller when she answers for you · it does not read your screen, does not act for you, and sends nothing from this service anywhere</string>
